[CENTER][SIZE=5][B]🚆 1.0.0.7 — The live web map update[/B][/SIZE]

[IMG]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mdreval/Create-Dynmap-Bridge/main/docs/images/web-map-overview.jpg[/IMG][/CENTER]

[LIST]
[*][B]🗺️ Live web map[/B] built into the plugin (like Create Track Map / MTR): every track with curves, Steam 'n' Rails gauges, portals, stations and [B]smoothly moving trains[/B]. Open [B]http://<server-ip>:25850/[/B].
[*][B]🔎 Train list[/B] with search, speed, current station and destination; click a train to follow it.
[*][B]🔌 Dynmap is now optional[/B] — without it the web map and commands keep working.
[*][B]🎛️ dynmap-stations / dynmap-trains[/B] switches (both on by default).
[*][B]🌍 English / Russian[/B] — set [B]language: "en"[/B] or [B]"ru"[/B] in config.yml.
[*][B]💬 /railmap[/B] gives every player a clickable link to the map.
[*][B]🚫 Blacklists[/B] hide stations and trains on the web map too.
[*][B]🔄 Automatic config upgrade[/B] — new settings are appended to your config.yml with comments.
[/LIST]

[B]Upgrade:[/B] delete the old jar, drop in 1.0.0.7, open TCP port [B]25850[/B] (or set web-map.port) and restart the server.
Full details are in the [B]Documentation[/B] tab.
